/// error 1

Cue key modifier ".enter" requires keydown or keyup.

/// error 2

Cue event modifiers .passive and .prevent cannot be combined.

/// error 3

Cue native event bindings require a static event name; dynamic v-on arguments and v-on objects are not supported.

/// error 4

Cue native event bindings require a static event name; dynamic v-on arguments and v-on objects are not supported.

/// error 5

Unsupported Cue native event "load". Supported events: pointerdown, pointermove, pointerup, pointercancel, pointerover, pointerout, pointerenter, pointerleave, gotpointercapture, lostpointercapture, click, keydown, keyup, focus, blur, focusin, focusout, beforeinput, input, change, compositionstart, compositionupdate, compositionend, wheel.